      "body": "### Godot version\n\n3.5.beta3 (and earlier)\n\n### System information\n\nManjaro KDE\n\n### Issue description\n\nChanging the constants for TabContainer, either through theme overrides or in themes themselves, does not change anything. The only one that does something is side_margin.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a TabContainer\r\nChange the theme override constants\r\nNothing happens except with side_margin\n\n### Minimal reproduction project\n\n_No response_",
